    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present 84 The Forum to the market, a bright and spacious first floor apartment located in the heart of Sandyford. The location is ideal for those wishing to commute into town with the Luas adjacent and the M50 only a 5 minutes' drive. Dundrum Town Centre, The Beacon South Quarter and The Beacon Hospital, are just some of the high profile businesses located close by while restaurants and a host of other amenities are right on the doorstep.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living/dining room which is open plan to the kitchen, two double bedrooms with one benefiting from an en suite and a bathroom which completes the accommodation. The property further benefits from one designated parking space and a South East facing balcony.\n\nNumerous tech giants such as Google and Microsoft are close by. The M50 north and south bound exits provides ease of access to all points north, southeast and west including Dublin Airport. The Stillorgan Road (N11) and the Stillorgan QBC is also nearby. Also close at hand is the Leopardstown Racecourse and Golf driving range, together with West Wood health and fitness centre and Carrickmines tennis club as well as a selection of local parks and sports grounds. Some of South Dublin's finest schools on your doorstep, including the new Nord Anglia International School, Rosemont school, Stepaside Educate Together, and Wesley College all within close proximity. UCD is also a short distance away and Trinity College easily accessed by the Luas.\n\n*Please note that the property is beign sold as seen, with furniture included."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nKitchen - 2.41m x 2.43m\n\n\nLiving /Dining Room - 3.88m x 6.2m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.68m x 3.78m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 1.46m x 1.74m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.63m x 5.37m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.53m x 1.90m\n\n\n"
